# More options pill/caret on About.
ipc panels settings about
wait 2
shot m1
note M1 read the "More options" position (bottom of the page, maybe after scrolling).
ptr move 1100 600 sleep 200 scroll 0 30
wait 1
rec m2 3 ptr move 1200 600 sleep 300 glide 1200 600 100 click sleep 1000 click
wait 1
note M2 caret turns over in about 150 ms, fast start and slow end (OutCubic) like the QML; groups appear and go; label flips (More/Fewer options). Click coordinates are guesses: read from the m1 shot.
ptr move 1200 600 sleep 300 glide 1200 600 100 click
wait 1
shot m2-open
note M2 More options open: extra groups appear below the button, label flipped, caret turned.
ptr move 1100 300 sleep 500 glide 1100 300 100
wait 1
shot m3-off
note M3 hover: the pill's Material layer / Glass fill fades about 150 ms (look at the hover recording if possible).
ipc panels settings appearance
wait 2
ipc panels settings about
wait 2
shot m4
note M4 after visiting another page and back, More options is closed again.
# MANUAL: M5 type a row label that lives inside More options in the settings search, click the result: More options opens and the row flashes
# MANUAL: M6 Tab to the button and press space: toggles; focus ring 2 px out (Glass 2 px wide, Material 3 px)
ipc panels close
